# Do NOT put real secrets in this webroot: Go Live serves the project directory.
# Backend configuration is read only from:
# ~/Library/Application Support/Sete Passos Development/auth-secret.env
# Created with directory 700 and file 600 by: node server/setup.mjs
# The matching auth.sqlite database is kept in that same private directory.
# No VITE_* secret, dotenv discovery, .env.local, external database or email transport.
# Development API: http://127.0.0.1:3007
# Only for isolated tests (never a production override):
# NODE_ENV=test
# SETE_PASSOS_TEST_DATA_DIR=<absolute private directory outside the project>
# SETE_PASSOS_TEST_PORT=3007
